 // 384 + 2c per 8-bit channel, exact both ways; alpha into plane 1), after a command buffer drew into it.
+// Bergamota: the same for a two-plane YCbCr surface (asteroids ast18/19: SpringBoard's Control Center and app-switcher
+// backdrops are 420f snapshots the render server draws INTO; decoded only, the surface kept its initial bytes = grey boxes).
+// BT.709 full/video range per the surface's format, luma per texel, one Cb/Cr pair per 2x2 (top-left sample).
+- (BOOL)bgYCbCrWriteBack
